      "id": "claim_3b10af17f52e44e48d343c14238919ab",
      "statement": "Stripe checkout for the audit fee is created by a server-side REST wrapper that posts a single payment session with the configured price id, canonical success and cancel URLs, managed payments enabled, and the portal client id embedded in metadata.",
