      "id": "claim_1682d3c6e2d9451290d183b212760952",
      "statement": "The Stripe REST client is intentionally SDK-free and server-only: it requires STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, uses HTTP Basic auth plus a preview Stripe-Version header, and raises a StripeApiError when Stripe returns an error response.",
