      "id": "claim_d4f161ecb0d34307b4b36a9d253d252a",
      "statement": "The webhook HTTP route reads the raw request body, verifies the Stripe-Signature header before parsing JSON, and maps invalid signatures or malformed events to 400 responses while misconfiguration or handler exceptions become 500 responses.",
