      "statement": "Paid-access fulfillment is persisted by upserting public.client_paid_reports on client_id with merge-duplicates semantics, writing unlocked state, unlocked_at, Stripe identifiers, and clerk_user_id only when known, while deliberately leaving title and html untouched.",
