      "id": "claim_4e59c47c27d648c6a038c4664cb9fcb1",
      "statement": "The client_paid_reports table is the storage boundary for Stripe-fulfilled unlocks: client_id is the primary key, title and html are nullable so payment can arrive before staging, unlocked defaults false, and the table is protected by RLS that denies anon access.",
